# Under the app's minimum (640x480): an older launcher ignores X-MinSize, so the app says so and closes on any key; a
# portrait canvas under X-Portrait (480x640, PDA mode, 0.5.0) gets it too (480x560).
title Net Toolbox: screens under 640x480
sizes 480x320 800x400 640x400 480x560

shot notice
expect noquit
key down
expect quit
